ed Wedding Favors from Botanical PaperWorks&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I love the idea of your favors! I defintely might do this too!","Attachments":[],"Id":617672,"PostDate":1236792435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Ayita<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I am doing plantable wildflowers seeds favors from Botanical Paperworks :<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.botanicalpaperworks.com\/category\/Plantable+Seed+Wedding+Favors\/3\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Plantable Seed Wedding Favors from Botanical PaperWorks<\/a><br \/> <br \/> We chose the flip-flops : <a href='http:\/\/www.botanicalpaperworks.com\/product\/Plantable+Flip+Flop+Favors\/346\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Plantable Flip Flop Favors - Plantable Seed Wedding Favors from Botanical PaperWorks<\/a><br \/> <br \/> They were shortlisted with the bookmarks :<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.botanicalpaperworks.com\/product\/Plantable+Seeded+Bookmarks\/202\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Plantable Seeded Bookmarks - Plantable Seed Wedding Favors from Botanical PaperWorks<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I love the idea of your favors! I defintely might do this too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><i>*Katie*<\/i><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klabate54@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1234804377,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214956.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":129,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KLaBate54","Id":214956,"Name":"KLaBate54","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6691307a562bb7830d67684376288ca2","RawContent":"We did luggage tags, we thought it went with the destination theme!","Attachments":[],"Id":617678,"PostDate":1236792950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We did luggage tags, we thought it went with the destination theme!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyblant@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220211540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211491.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyblant","Id":211491,"Name":"amyblant","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d52495611dd76d37d771031585ce64c1","RawContent":"We&#039;re doing personalized fans...to help with the heat and they look great!\n \n We will also have small bottles of bubbles with a our name tag attatched. I like the hot sauce idea too!","Attachments":[],"Id":617742,"PostDate":1236796271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're doing personalized fans...to help with the heat and they look great!<br \/> <br \/> We will also have small bottles of bubbles with a our name tag attatched. I like the hot sauce idea too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>A Complete Dream~<\/span><br><span>Take a peek @ our photos<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?aid=99662&id=661814093&l=6c5301b960\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?ai...3&l=6c5301b960<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jamilandtashaforever.wedquarters.com\">www.jamilandtashaforever.wedquarters.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10719;25\/st\/20090801\/e\/we%27ve+been+Mr.+%26amp%3B+Mrs~\/k\/514d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...514d\/event.png<\/a><span>5<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tasha.scott1105@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232822512,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214254.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":71,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BLUSH*","Id":214254,"Name":"BLUSH*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e77815c7f3bf33404d0cf5081a6ea073","RawContent":"I am doing fans (Oriental Trading Comp in my colors Brown and Teal) ($.90 a piece) and bubbles for the day of the wedding. I am also doing hand decorated OOTbags (white totes from Michaels and I painted with special design in my colors, so fun! )Filled with goodies, like Pashminas for the ladies (not sure what for guys yet), luggage tags (found them at Michaels tonight in the discount bins, 2 for $3 and then I decorated with bling stars and travel stickers, so cute!) I was busy tonight! I would post, but dont think I have enough points. Boo! I will see if I can save enough points to post all my stuff...I am happy to be filling my time with Arts and Crafts. I just hope everyone likes it as much as I do. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":618262,"PostDate":1236832470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am doing fans (Oriental Trading Comp in my colors Brown and Teal) ($.90 a piece) and bubbles for the day of the wedding. I am also doing hand decorated OOTbags (white totes from Michaels and I painted with special design in my colors, so fun! )Filled with goodies, like Pashminas for the ladies (not sure what for guys yet), luggage tags (found them at Michaels tonight in the discount bins, 2 for $3 and then I decorated with bling stars and travel stickers, so cute!) I was busy tonight! I would post, but dont think I have enough points. Boo! I will see if I can save enough points to post all my stuff...I am happy to be filling my time with Arts and Crafts. I just hope everyone likes it as much as I do. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i693.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv292\/bkaplan\/TTDbeach2.jpg\">http:\/\/i693.photobucket.com\/albums\/v...\/TTDbeach2.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20090705\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/2ac7\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...2ac7\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bessbo2004@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1226014110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212570.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":83,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BBtoB","Id":212570,"Name":"BBtoB","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"31705","Title":"Wedding Favor Ideas","LastPostDate":1462721526},"Pages":{"TotalItems":158,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
