margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;dbellie1414&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Don&#039;t know if it&#039;s unique UNIQUE but it worked for us... \n \n \n We did favors that doubled as place cards too... \n \n I ordered glass starfish from favorsandflowers.com, link is below:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.favorsandflowers.com\/starfish-glass-paperweight-favor.htm\"&gt;Starfish Glass Paperweight Favor&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n and than I ordered personalized favor tags with each person&#039;s full name and Table ______ underneath from them too! \n \n I just went to michaels and got a hole punture and some ribbon and tied them on...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Wow....those are super cute. I think I will be ordering them. I have a starfish theme, so they will be perfect. Thanks for sharing","Attachments":[],"Id":620950,"PostDate":1237074614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>dbellie1414<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Don't know if it's unique UNIQUE but it worked for us... <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> We did favors that doubled as place cards too... <br \/> <br \/> I ordered glass starfish from favorsandflowers.com, link is below:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.favorsandflowers.com\/starfish-glass-paperweight-favor.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Starfish Glass Paperweight Favor<\/a><br \/> <br \/> and than I ordered personalized favor tags with each person's full name and Table ______ underneath from them too! <br \/> <br \/> I just went to michaels and got a hole punture and some ribbon and tied them on...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Wow....those are super cute. I think I will be ordering them. I have a starfish theme, so they will be perfect. Thanks for sharing\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heatherwedding1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1234490675,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214867.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hsims1","Id":214867,"Name":"hsims1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31705,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77d934704aa0fb4991dc491a83ee2a82","RawContent":"instead of doing traditional favors, we decided to donate to a charity in mexico (we&#039;re having our wedding there)","Attachments":[],"Id":620974,"PostDate":1237077235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n 