{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":517,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1911053,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":286263,"Name":"jbbb24","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1455793984,"LastPoster":{"Id":283425,"Name":"jsalazarmtz","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283425.jpg?_r=1458157921","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":188,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1911053,"PostDate":1455793984,"PostContent":"Hi, we are looking for a resort to have a destination wedding somewhere in the Cancun\/Riviera May...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlball1217@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.216.7.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455792836,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jbbb24","Id":286263,"Name":"jbbb24","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.216.7.5","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bab41a4f93c2643d90bb434810b4b0a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi, we are looking for a resort to have a destination wedding somewhere in the Cancun\/Riviera Maya, Isla Mujeres area. We have been to Secrets Maroma Beach and are going to the Excellence Playa Mujeres this summer.&amp;nbsp; I know these are more expensive resorts and want to be respective to our guests and don&#039;t want to price them out of coming to our wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also have two boys, ages 4 and 6 (5 and &amp;amp; at the time of the wedding) and want this to be fun for them as well.&amp;nbsp; Can anyone recommend a kid friendly resort that won&#039;t break the bank and still has some luxury amenities???&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911053,"PostDate":1455793984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, we are looking for a resort to have a destination wedding somewhere in the Cancun\/Riviera Maya, Isla Mujeres area. We have been to Secrets Maroma Beach and are going to the Excellence Playa Mujeres this summer.\u00a0 I know these are more expensive resorts and want to be respective to our guests and don't want to price them out of coming to our wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also have two boys, ages 4 and 6 (5 and & at the time of the wedding) and want this to be fun for them as well.\u00a0 Can anyone recommend a kid friendly resort that won't break the bank and still has some luxury amenities???<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlball1217@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.216.7.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455792836,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jbbb24","Id":286263,"Name":"jbbb24","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79947,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 18 February 2016 - 03:14 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1455808457,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cea7c553b487b070df422fdf7adcae29","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community jbbb24 and Congrats on your upcoming dw in our magnificent Mayan Riviera!!! It&#039;s a very popular choice of destinations for many great reasons - the vast selection of wedding venue options - being one of them :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re sure to find Lots of excellent resources here to help you with your planning decisions, so well done on your great start already!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured recently....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;MTM Blog posts: ...enjoy!&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\/tag\/Azul-Fives-Wedding&#039;&gt;Azul Fives Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_642c39efbf3a4e4b9c79ecb4b702d413.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1246,h_831,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_642c39efbf3a4e4b9c79ecb4b702d413.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_642c39efbf3a4e4b9c79ecb4b702d413.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\/tag\/Sandos-Cancun-Wedding&#039;&gt;Sandos Cancun Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6b7f82a726aa40ec8acc1f50d7f97a3c.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6b7f82a726aa40ec8acc1f50d7f97a3c.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6b7f82a726aa40ec8acc1f50d7f97a3c.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Blue-Venado-Beach-Club-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56ae7e180cf2dc1600da0999&#039;&gt;Blue Venado Beach Club Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_de498042fd1040f0ab9dc3c40714bac6.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_de498042fd1040f0ab9dc3c40714bac6.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_de498042fd1040f0ab9dc3c40714bac6.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a6ed402bdbe94a6ba5de164e94226fb2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a6ed402bdbe94a6ba5de164e94226fb2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a6ed402bdbe94a6ba5de164e94226fb2.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_258a35b9115c4848a513dab43f01b1b4.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_258a35b9115c4848a513dab43f01b1b4.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_258a35b9115c4848a513dab43f01b1b4.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Palladium-Wedding-Bells\/k7mfu\/56c0c4220cf2ccb6be47cefb&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_bd7d2c073a0a4e55a7bc6bdcfce16ac4.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_bd7d2c073a0a4e55a7bc6bdcfce16ac4.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_bd7d2c073a0a4e55a7bc6bdcfce16ac4.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Paradisus-Wedding\/k7mfu\/569274d90cf2e94e3fb07160&#039;&gt;Paradisus Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_109faaae4c2a43cb89fd29aa9ad7c1d3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_109faaae4c2a43cb89fd29aa9ad7c1d3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_109faaae4c2a43cb89fd29aa9ad7c1d3.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Sunset-Princess-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56c0e9450cf2b079d126c7ff&#039;&gt;Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0be45da8a11d40ada2105e227d491238.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0be45da8a11d40ada2105e227d491238.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0be45da8a11d40ada2105e227d491238.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1c0bb1ff0e644fc983d05cde888b9253.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1c0bb1ff0e644fc983d05cde888b9253.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1c0bb1ff0e644fc983d05cde888b9253.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_307b93d782f54c44bf7e38543a5425d9.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_307b93d782f54c44bf7e38543a5425d9.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_307b93d782f54c44bf7e38543a5425d9.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911062,"PostDate":1455807721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community jbbb24 and Congrats on your upcoming dw in our magnificent Mayan Riviera!!! It's a very popular choice of destinations for many great reasons - the vast selection of wedding venue options - being one of them <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're sure to find Lots of excellent resources here to help you with your planning decisions, so well done on your great start already!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured recently....taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MTM Blog posts: ...enjoy!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\/tag\/Azul-Fives-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Fives Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_642c39efbf3a4e4b9c79ecb4b702d413.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1246,h_831,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_642c39efbf3a4e4b9c79ecb4b702d413.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_642c39efbf3a4e4b9c79ecb4b702d413.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\/tag\/Sandos-Cancun-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sandos Cancun Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6b7f82a726aa40ec8acc1f50d7f97a3c.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6b7f82a726aa40ec8acc1f50d7f97a3c.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6b7f82a726aa40ec8acc1f50d7f97a3c.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d480596efc2c49e8b8adf1a5ff2c3a86.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Blue-Venado-Beach-Club-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56ae7e180cf2dc1600da0999' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Blue Venado Beach Club Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_de498042fd1040f0ab9dc3c40714bac6.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_de498042fd1040f0ab9dc3c40714bac6.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_de498042fd1040f0ab9dc3c40714bac6.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a6ed402bdbe94a6ba5de164e94226fb2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a6ed402bdbe94a6ba5de164e94226fb2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a6ed402bdbe94a6ba5de164e94226fb2.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_258a35b9115c4848a513dab43f01b1b4.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_258a35b9115c4848a513dab43f01b1b4.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_258a35b9115c4848a513dab43f01b1b4.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Palladium-Wedding-Bells\/k7mfu\/56c0c4220cf2ccb6be47cefb' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_bd7d2c073a0a4e55a7bc6bdcfce16ac4.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_bd7d2c073a0a4e55a7bc6bdcfce16ac4.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_bd7d2c073a0a4e55a7bc6bdcfce16ac4.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Paradisus-Wedding\/k7mfu\/569274d90cf2e94e3fb07160' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Paradisus Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_109faaae4c2a43cb89fd29aa9ad7c1d3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_109faaae4c2a43cb89fd29aa9ad7c1d3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_109faaae4c2a43cb89fd29aa9ad7c1d3.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Sunset-Princess-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56c0e9450cf2b079d126c7ff' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_0be45da8a11d40ada2105e227d491238.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_0be45da8a11d40ada2105e227d491238.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_0be45da8a11d40ada2105e227d491238.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1c0bb1ff0e644fc983d05cde888b9253.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1c0bb1ff0e644fc983d05cde888b9253.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1c0bb1ff0e644fc983d05cde888b9253.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_307b93d782f54c44bf7e38543a5425d9.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_307b93d782f54c44bf7e38543a5425d9.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_307b93d782f54c44bf7e38543a5425d9.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"253b34f6271ac10720314bd73ce61c6e","RawContent":"Check out Sandos Caracol Eco Resort in Playa.   We are having our wedding there.  My travel agent highly recommended it for us because the wedding coordinator is good and there are lots of things to do there as well.  There&#039;s a kids waterslide park and an adult one is under construction. \n\n\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1911834,"PostDate":1457841564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Check out Sandos Caracol Eco Resort in Playa.   We are having our wedding there.  My travel agent highly recommended it for us because the wedding coordinator is good and there are lots of things to do there as well.  There's a kids waterslide park and an adult one is under construction. <br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900W8 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpenner@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"68.150.177.36","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1451945669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285764.jpg?_r=1451960071","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tpenner","Id":285764,"Name":"tpenner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.241.240.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac8721149f59ea3f2c8ccf5df278822b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just came back from my wedding (off resort) but we stayed at Sandos Caracol because they had a lot of things for the kids to do!&amp;nbsp; We had a total of 10 kids&amp;nbsp; coming to our wedding and they all had a blast between the pool, waterpark and the kids club.   100% recommended!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911972,"PostDate":1458146812,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just came back from my wedding (off resort) but we stayed at Sandos Caracol because they had a lot of things for the kids to do!\u00a0 We had a total of 10 kids\u00a0 coming to our wedding and they all had a blast between the pool, waterpark and the kids club.\u00a0\u00a0 100% recommended!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsalazarmtz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433684301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283425.jpg?_r=1458157921","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":188,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsalazarmtz","Id":283425,"Name":"jsalazarmtz","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79947","Title":"Picking A Resort That Will Be Good For Kids Too!","LastPostDate":1458146812},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
